              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:04:45 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Malis MIS</span></span></p>\n<p>Designed for confined anatomical spaces, Malis MIS Dual Irrigating Bipolar Forceps feature precise control, irrigation, enhanced visibility and maneuverability. Ultra-thin tines and a low-profile shoulder design provide access to working areas while supporting delicate surgical procedures.</p>\n",
