              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:04:45 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Malis Standard</span></span></p>\n<p>The Malis Standard forceps deliver precision and control with a lightweight flexible cord, spring force for tactile feedback, and a sleek bayonet design for improved visualization. The same superb non-stick coagulation performance—with enhanced control and handling.</p>\n<p>Designed for surgeons seeking bipolar surgical forceps that combine proprietary non-stick technology, precise tip alignment and balanced ergonomics, Malis Standard forceps help provide consistent coagulation performance and control during delicate surgical procedures.&nbsp;</p>\n",
