              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-e895b4dde6@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:06:59 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Malis Dual Irrigating</span></span></p>\n<p>The Malis Dual Irrigating Forceps are Stryker's first disposable device with irrigation channels inside both of its branches—delivering precise fluid through each tip to keep the surgical field of vision clear during electrosurgery.<br>\n</p>\n<p>You get the same superb non-stick coagulation performance—plus integrated irrigation.</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 24 2026 18:40:53 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            },
