          "col1": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4162137458@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:15:28 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Malis Bipolar Generator and Irrigator system</span></span></p>\n<p>The Malis Bipolar Generator combines an innovative and intuitive user interface, the performance of DUAL WAVE waveform technology and proven digital electronics that delivers precision controlled power and irrigation in one package.</p>\n<p>The large color display is designed to facilitate readability and usability. Multifunctional on-screen controls and dedicated CUT and COAG knobs let you make setting changes quickly and accurately. Programmable user profiles support convenient and consistent setup.</p>\n<p>The Malis Bipolar Generator continues to use the asynchronous, aperiodic Malis waveform coupled with ultra-low output to deliver consistent control during coagulation. High-power and micro-bipolar CUT and COAG modes makes the bipolar suitable for a range of neurosurgical applications.</p>\n<p>Leveraging more than 40 years of continuous product improvements, the Malis Bipolar Generator has evolved to address the needs of neurosurgical users. In addition to maximizing uptime, you’ll boost efficiency by using tested accessories and existing consumables that reduce the need for additional training and duplicate inventories.</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 21 2026 18:51:23 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            },
            "text_1589884730": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:19:03 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><br>\n1. DUAL WAVE technology</span> provides confidence during cutting and coagulating<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">2. Oversized color screen</span> for easy comprehension<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">3. Irrigator</span> optional integrated irrigator<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">4. Programmable user profiles</span> store information for up to eight surgeons<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">5. CUT and COAG nobs</span> facilitate quick setting adjustments<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">6. Independant bipolar outputs</span> enhance functionality</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 01 2019 19:23:28 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
