      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Precision tips and a sleek bayonet design</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Single-use design avoids cumulative wear and tear</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Refined ergonomics and fine-tuned spring force to enhance control and tactile feedback<sup>1</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Flexible, lightweight 24-inch cord for less backend weight</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "6": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Remote connection plug for preferred balance</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "7": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Sterile and disposable</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "8": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>MIS model – Ultra-thin tines and low-profile shoulders help maximize working space and access<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "9": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>MIS model – Deliver precise control, enhanced visibility and maneuverability in confined anatomical spaces<sup>2</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "10": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Slim model – Specially designed for superior access to narrow surgical fields</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "11": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Dual irrigating model<sup>1 </sup>– Supports cooling and debris management at the tips for consistent bipolar coagulation</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "12": {
