  "rte": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4162137458@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Malis Disposable Bipolar Forceps deliver optimal sightlines, balanced high-comfort ergonomics, and superb non-stick coagulation performance. Since 2006, Malis Standard Bipolar Forceps have performed with excellence in neurosurgery and more. Available in Standard, Slim, Dual Irrigating and MIS configurations, Malis Disposable Bipolar Forceps are designed to support a variety of surgical approaches and anatomical challenges.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Introducing the new Malis MIS Dual Irrigating Non-Stick Bipolar Forceps</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"> Designed for confined anatomical spaces.</span></b></span></b></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Features and benefits</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proprietary non-stick technology that is designed to reduce sticking and charring<sup>1</sup></li>\n<li>Precision tips and a sleek bayonet design</li>\n<li>Single-use design avoids cumulative wear and tear</li>\n<li>Refined ergonomics and fine-tuned spring force to enhance control and tactile feedback<sup>1</sup></li>\n<li>Flexible, lightweight 24-inch cord for less backend weight</li>\n<li>Remote connection plug for preferred balance</li>\n<li>Sterile and disposable</li>\n<li>MIS model – Ultra-thin tines and low-profile shoulders help maximize working space and access<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>MIS model – Deliver precise control, enhanced visibility and maneuverability in confined anatomical spaces<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>Slim model – Specially designed for superior access to narrow surgical fields</li>\n<li>Dual irrigating model<sup>1</sup> – Supports cooling and debris management at the tips for consistent bipolar coagulation&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Malis Bipolar Generator – Designed for precision-controlled power and irrigation<sup>1&nbsp;</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Oct 02 2026 19:22:43 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  }
